-- Worked cases of the seat questions for sections 239 to 249ג (fragment D). Every expected value is written from the text of the section named beside it.
-- Company arguments (the first two inputs of a company question): `TRUE FALSE` is a public company (listed shares held by the public, no listed bonds),
-- `FALSE FALSE` is a private company that is not a bond company, `FALSE TRUE` is a private bond company.

§§ `מקרים: סעיף 239`

-- 239(א): a public company and a private bond company must have external directors, at least two; a private company that is not a bond company need not.
