-- 249א(ב): if the company did not decide on the continuation of his term, it ends at the end of three months. Arguments: the company decided; months since it became a private company that is not a bond company.
#ASSERT `אחרי כמה חודשים נפסקת כהונתי כדירקטור חיצוני אם החברה לא החליטה על המשכתה` EQUALS 3
